    "statement": "A2. Answer:\n\n| Star A: | Star B: | Star C: |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\alpha$ Cyg | $\\alpha$ Lyr | $\\alpha$ Aur |\n\nThe order is not important."
   },
